            "title": "같은 공격과 다른 피격 영역",
            "lines": [
              "That clearly touched. Why was there no hit?",
              "The green region receives damage. It is the hurtbox.",
              "Health drops when it overlaps the red attack region: the hitbox.",
              "Let’s compare the same attack.",
              "Make the region as wide as the body, and it hits. Shrink it slightly, and it misses.",
              "The appearance is unchanged. Only the receiving region changed.",
              "That character survived because these two regions decided the hit, rather than the visible body."
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
